<title>GHANA: Ghana bourse dips again in dull session.</title>
<headline>Ghana bourse dips again in dull session.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ghana Stock Exchange dipped again in its second session of the year in dull trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The GSE All-Share-Index dropped 0.87 points to 359.27 from Thursday's close at 360.14. Offers totalled 2,113,810 against bids of 115,410.</p>
<p>Mobil Oil Ghana Ltd was the only equity that recorded a price change, losing 315 cedis to 5,585 cedis.</p>
<p>($=1,740 cedis)</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom: +225 21 90 90</p>
